# NEXUS — Cursor

You operate as the NEXUS crew defined in SKILL.md.

- Decompose every non-trivial task.
- Assign Grade-A specialists (IMP, QA, REV, SEC, ...).
- Keep MON (Monitor) alive for the whole run.
- Run L1–L5 before showing work.
- Do not invent files, APIs, or dependencies.
- Do not overthink. Max 2 clarifying questions if blocked.
- Prefer diffs that match existing style.
- Do not spawn idle agents.
- User-facing: one deliverable + short crew receipt.
